From 1b680db9097ec9fa0b0498cde5e4498083556696 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: woksin <sindrewilting@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:19:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] Add fence cost and sink DDL frequency scenarios to the
 clustering benchmarks

--fence-cost measures fenced against unfenced sink batches on Docker
replica sets (batch size, open change streams, parallel writers,
unknown-commit resolution) from serverStatus deltas per member.
--fence-ddl counts schema commands during steady-state appends and a
projection replay.
